{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBetaZeroPadding","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBetaZeroPadding","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTHookFormulaBetaProdMonoid"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.length_append_replicate_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.length_append_replicate_zero","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTBetaZeroPadding.lean#L97-L101","doc":"The padded list has length `r` when `r` is at least the number of nonzero rows. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.sorted_append_replicate_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.sorted_append_replicate_zero","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTBetaZeroPadding.lean#L87-L95","doc":"Padding with empty rows preserves weak decrease. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooksF_append_replicate_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.prodHooksF_append_replicate_zero","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTBetaZeroPadding.lean#L66-L85","doc":"**Empty rows do not change the hook product.**  Pad the partition out to `r` rows, then apply the\nβ-number machinery at `r` — the hook side is unaffected. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.colLen_append_replicate_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.colLen_append_replicate_zero","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTBetaZeroPadding.lean#L52-L64","doc":"Padding with empty rows changes no column length: `colLen` counts parts `> j`, and `0` is never\n`> j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.getD_append_replicate_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.getD_append_replicate_zero","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTBetaZeroPadding.lean#L41-L50","doc":"Padding with empty rows changes no row length — including the padded positions, where both\nsides are `0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.getD_eq_zero_of_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTBeta.getD_eq_zero_of_le","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTBetaZeroPadding.lean#L36-L39","doc":"Out of range, `getD` is the default. ","signatureChunk":0}]}